config FREETZ_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_FRITZCONNECTION
	bool "fritzconnection 1.15.1"
	depends on FREETZ_PACKAGE_PYTHON3
	select FREETZ_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_REQUESTS
	default n
	help
		Library to talk to the TR-064 interface of a FRITZ!Box from
		Python: it reads the device and network status and it can call the
		actions of the router, for example for presence detection
		(devices seen by the WLAN) or for rebooting the box.

		It is installed for the Domoticz plugin that uses it
		(domoticz-fritz-presence), but it can also be used by scripts on
		the box, for example from the Freetz configuration pages.
